  "question": {
    "text": "Choose the correct length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;versus square of time period <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></math> ) graph for a simple pendulum executing simple harmonic motion."
